# Intentionally empty.
#
# The Vite dev server proxies /api to the backend, so the frontend needs no
# base URL and no environment variables at all.
#
# Do not add a GITHUB_TOKEN here, or any secret in a VITE_ variable. Vite
# inlines every VITE_-prefixed value into the public JavaScript bundle, so it
# would be readable by anyone who opens the page. The backend reads the token
# from its own environment and is the only thing that talks to GitHub.
#
# frontend/dist is served by the backend itself in production, so there is no
# separate API origin to configure there either -- see README.md.
